#: diffview/specialdiff.py:384
msgid "To complete the addition of this submodule, you should [absorb the submodule] into the parent repository."
msgstr "이 서브모듈 추가를 완료하려면 [서브모듈을 흡수]하여 상위 저장소에 편입시키세요."

#: diffview/specialdiff.py:389
#, python-brace-format
msgid "To complete the addition of this submodule, [register it in {gitmodules}]."
msgstr "이 서브모듈 추가를 완료하려면 [{gitmodules}에 등록]하세요."

